{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_3001_p", "source_sha256": "5353b477d8d9642a69c6202e0e90a7db52db3845ec64f915f0447ae5e000a459", "ja": "どうした、桃子。なんだか緊張した顔して……\nお腹でも痛いのか？", "zh": "怎么了，桃子？总觉得你看起来很紧张……\n是肚子痛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
