{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_3005_049mom", "source_sha256": "2960261da0ff1405f2ae2b3050007f978b175753f674e1f6edf0fe2633369917", "ja": "お……お兄ちゃんだったら、どうする？\nあんまり会いたくない人に会っちゃったときとか……。", "zh": "如……如果是大哥哥遇到这种状况，你会怎么做？\n像是不小心碰到不想遇见的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_3006_p", "source_sha256": "4abd84cd160c631eb28e035fa9aecd8447283601dbec06903154a10d9b1a8889", "ja": "どうしたら、か。そうだな……。", "zh": "要怎么办吗？这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
